stric carcinoma</article-title><source>Yonsei Med J</source><year>2002</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>377</fpage><lpage>80</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12089748</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Birla</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name><name><surname>Bowden</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Solitary bony metastasis as the first sign of malignant gastric tumor recurrence</article-title><source>Ann Surg</source><year>1975</year><volume>182</volume><fpage>45</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1147708</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kammori</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Seto</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Haniuda</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Kawahara</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Takubo</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ebdo</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A case of bone metastasis from gastric carcinoma after a nine-year-disease free interval</article-title><source>Jpn J Clin Oncol</source><year>2001</year><volume>31</volume><fpage>407</fpage><lpage>9</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11574636</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/jjco/hye074</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kobayashi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Araki</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsuura</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kawai</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Moriki</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early gastric cancer giving rise to bone and brain metastases: a review of the Japanese Literature</article-title><source>Hepatogastroenterology</source><year>2002</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>1751</fpage><lpage>54</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12397785</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hirai</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Kikuchi</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hashimoto</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Skull base metastasis from gastric cancer: Case report</article-title><source>Neurol Med Cir</source><year>1992</year><volume>32</volume><fpage>908</fpage><lpage>10</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1282683</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Murai</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Koga</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagamachi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Nishikawa</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsuki</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Kusumoto</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Radiotherapy in bone metastasis with special reference to its effect on relieving pain</article-title><source>Gan No Rinsho</source><year>1989</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>1149</fpage><lpage>52</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2550686</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maekawa</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Furya</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Toyokawa</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinugasa</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fukano</surname><given-na